<title>USA: Electric &amp; Gas retains firm as advisor.</title>
<headline>Electric &amp; Gas retains firm as advisor.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electric &amp; Gas Technology Inc said on Tuesday it has retained Ladenburg Thalmann &amp; Co Inc as its exclusive financial advisor.</p>
<p>&quot;Ladenburg will play a vital role in effecting our acquisition strategy to further our penetration of the billion dollar purified and healthy drinking water market,&quot; Dan Zimmerman, vice president and director of the company, said in a statement.</p>
</text>
